<title>UK: TENNIS-SAMPRAS WINS WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAMPRAS WINS WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pete Sampras of the U.S. won the men's singles title at Wimbledon on Sunday when he beat Cedric Pioline of France 6-4 6-2 6-4 in the final.</p>
</text>
